(f) the roadmap for ensuring long-term sustainability of India’s space assets in increasingly congested orbital regions?

(a) the major achievements of Government during the last one year in enhancing domestic coal production, including the highest-ever coal production and dispatch recorded during 2024–25;
(b) the measures taken to improve operational efficiency, strengthen coal evacuation infrastructure and ensure adequate coal supply to the power sector and other key industries;
(c) the initiatives undertaken to reduce dependence on imported coal through increased domestic production and improved logistics; and
(d) the expected contribution of these initiatives towards strengthening India’s energy security and supporting sustained economic growth?

(a) the major policy reforms undertaken during the last one year to strengthen the coal sector including in Chhattisgarh coal regions and support India’s growing energy requirements;
(b) the measures taken to improve coal allocation, logistics, evacuation infrastructure and coordination with the power sector for ensuring uninterrupted fuel supply;
(c) the initiatives undertaken to promote technological innovation, sustainable mining and diversification of coal utilisation through value-added products; and
(d) the roadmap for strengthening the coal sector in alignment with the objectives of Atmanirbhar Bharat and Viksit Bharat@ 2047?

(a) the number of applications received, approved, rejected and pending under the Design Linked Incentive (DLI) Scheme, year-wise, since its launch;
(b) whether the Ministry has identified market access challenges faced by startups supported under the DLI Scheme;
(c) if so, the details thereof; and
(d) the steps being taken to connect entities supported by DLI with electronics manufacturers and global semiconductor supply chains?

(a) the current status of implementation of Production Linked Incentive (PLI) schemes applicable across various sectors;
(b) the details of investment received, production achieved and employment generated so far under these schemes;
(c) the details of the performance and top-performing sectors under the PLI framework, sector-wise;
(d) whether any mid-term amendments or extension of duration have been made in these schemes, if so, the details thereof; and
(e) the details of the steps taken by Government to boost manufacturing, exports and the Aatmanirbhar Bharat initiative through these schemes?

(a) the specific steps taken by the Ministry to improve 'Ease of Doing Business', including reforms in labour, land taxation, insolvency and the impact on India’s ranking in global indices;
